            "review_text": "Binod S\nSydney, Australia4 contributions\n0\nAVOID!! Close the restaurant.\nMay 2026 • Couples\nThe service was poor. I'd to ask the cashier to get someone to come and take my order while there were three waitresses sitting outside gossipping. The guy who took the order didn't seem to want to take any order and lacked any professionalism. The food tasted bland and was over priced. We wanted to order more but after watching the reviews ended up with just vegetable pizza which was a wise decision. We didn't see the reviews earlier as we were starving. The pizza was nothing but just the base, cheese and a few tomatoes priced at 215,000 VND which is a lot given it was below par.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nAVOID the restaurant.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 20, 2026",
