            "review_text": "HolidaymakerfromHove\nBrighton and Hove, United Kingdom4738 contributions\n0\nLakeside Lunch in bustling Hanoi….\nApr 2026 • Couples\nWe came for lunch as beautiful location and looked busy.\n\nScruffier inside than we expected it to be from the outside. Could do with new menus.\n\nService was good, beers were good and food - spaghetti carbonara and a vegetable noodles - were very tasty. Not much of a wait for food at all.\n\nThe lakeside terrace is lovely but we chose to sit inside in the cool. A little calm oasis amidst the madness!\n\nReasonably priced for the area.\n\nRecommended for a quick bite. More could be done with the place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 21, 2026",
