            "review_text": "LeoS\nSydney, Australia33 contributions\n0\nLocation is the highlight\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nThe highlight of this restaurant is the location - particularly at night overlooking Lake Hoan Kiem. We were able to get a table on the verandah right beside the lake without a booking. The food was reasonable, but definitely far from the best we had on our holiday. They had also run out of noodles so a number of menu items weren't available that evening, however they did provide an alternative for one of the dishes normally served with noodles to be served with rice instead. The food came out quickly. Staff weren't overly attentive, requiring us to flag them down multiple times.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 19, 2026",
