            "review_text": "Milpol T\n74 contributions\n0\nShocking service\nSep 2025 • Couples\nMain meal was fine, then we ordered ice cream, my wife's was fine. I ordered the three scoop fruit ice cream with fresh fruit and whipped cream, when it came it was pistachio and coffee and a blackcurrant ice cream. I complained that pistachio is a nut and not fruit, also coffee isn't fruit. They tried several ways to make me pay and I explained I can't eat nuts and I don't like coffee. I explained I am not paying for it and if it is added to my bill I will not pay it. They eventually removed it from my bill, needless to say I will not return here. The looks they gave us when we paid and left was horrendous as if we were at fault.\nRead more\nWritten September 12, 2025",
